From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 11:53:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] platform: add a fused-MoE router platform hook

What: Adds Platform.get_fused_moe_router(params) (default None) and asks
  it first in create_fused_moe_router, passing the factory's arguments.
  A non-None router replaces the upstream selection; None keeps it.
Why: Out-of-tree platforms (the vllm-sm70 plugin) need to swap in a
  Volta top-k router (Flint fused router, K13) without editing each MoE
  layer; router selection only happens in
  vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/router/router_factory.py:126.
Upstream-files: vllm/platforms/interface.py, vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/router/router_factory.py
Kill-switch: hook returns None -> upstream (no plugin, or VLLM_SM70_FLINT_FUSED_ROUTER=0)
Tests: sm70/tests/plugin/test_u3_router_hook.py
Upstream-status: candidate

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011nZrmUQtD6qJskP867jP1x

diff --git a/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/router/router_factory.py b/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/router/router_factory.py
index c4c875d153de..936bf24d3401 100644
--- a/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/router/router_factory.py
+++ b/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/router/router_factory.py
@@ -123,6 +123,9 @@ def create_fused_moe_router(
         An instance of the appropriate FusedMoERouter subclass
 
     """
+    platform_router = current_platform.get_fused_moe_router(dict(locals()))
+    if platform_router is not None:
+        return platform_router
     router: FusedMoERouter | None = None
     if zero_expert_type is not None:
         assert num_logical_experts is not None, (
diff --git a/vllm/platforms/interface.py b/vllm/platforms/interface.py
index 765a64441505..31b35de88f45 100644
--- a/vllm/platforms/interface.py
+++ b/vllm/platforms/interface.py
@@ -1212,6 +1212,12 @@ class Platform:
     def kernel_warmup(cls, worker: Any) -> None:
         """Warm up platform kernels before CUDA graph capture."""
 
+    @classmethod
+    def get_fused_moe_router(cls, params: dict[str, Any]) -> Any:
+        """Return a platform FusedMoERouter for these factory params, or None
+        for upstream."""
+        return None
+
     @classmethod
     def get_punica_wrapper(cls) -> str:
         """Return the punica wrapper for current platform."""
